{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8bad6006945d280a2a2","chatId":"7d3cafa9e35842f8ba9e9faa5e98498b","sessionId":null,"userId":68534,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"C\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"C\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":936,"promptTokens":1463,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:02"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00757473889837627,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8bad6006945d280a2a0","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369722378,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:02","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8bad6006945d280a2a0","chatId":"7d3cafa9e35842f8ba9e9faa5e98498b","sessionId":null,"userId":68534,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小蕾快要从学院毕业了，此时她的朋友小琦说她不能来参加她的毕业典礼。毕业典礼那天，小蕾走上舞台领取学位证书时，她突然听到一声小琦的欢呼。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小琦最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 自豪\nB) 爱护\nC) 愧疚\nD) 失望\nE) 无感\nF) 尴尬\n\n## 问题 2\n小琦为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她为她朋友毕业而高兴并想要支持她\nB) 她感到被忽视，想要引起关注\nC) 她因为告诉小蕾她不能来而感到内疚\nD) 她也希望能毕业","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00757473889837627,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8bad6006945d280a2a2","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369722376,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:02","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"9fe34f15562c4174b9c65ac91fa63b20"}